$ Card report deck (tests/test_cards.py): the cards nastran-pv draws since the report (9-node
$ CQUAD, PLOTEL, MPCADD) and one of each kind of skipped card, with the counts worked out by
$ hand in test_cards.REPORT.
SOL 101
CEND
SUBCASE 1
  MPC = 60
  SPC = 1
  LOAD = 9
BEGIN BULK
$ a 2 x 1 plate on a 0.5 grid: rows y = 0, 0.5, 1 hold grids 1-5, 6-10, 11-15
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.
GRID,2,,0.5,0.,0.
GRID,3,,1.,0.,0.
GRID,4,,1.5,0.,0.
GRID,5,,2.,0.,0.
GRID,6,,0.,0.5,0.
GRID,7,,0.5,0.5,0.
GRID,8,,1.,0.5,0.
GRID,9,,1.5,0.5,0.
GRID,10,,2.,0.5,0.
GRID,11,,0.,1.,0.
GRID,12,,0.5,1.,0.
GRID,13,,1.,1.,0.
GRID,14,,1.5,1.,0.
GRID,15,,2.,1.,0.
SPOINT,101,102
MAT1,1,7.e10,,0.3,2.
PSHELL,1,1,0.1
$ drawn: CQUAD 10 with all 9 grids (biquadratic), CQUAD 11 without G9 (quadratic)
CQUAD,10,1,1,3,13,11,2,8
,12,6,7
CQUAD,11,1,3,5,15,13,4,10
,14,8
$ drawn: PLOTEL lines, MPC legs, MPCADD 60 = sets 50 + 51
PLOTEL,20,1,5
PLOTEL,21,11,15
MPC,50,1,1,1.,15,1,-1.
MPC,51,5,2,1.,11,2,-1.
MPC,52,2,3,1.,14,3,-1.
MPCADD,60,50,51
$ heat transfer: a thermal damper between two grids, a CHBDYP below
MAT4,2,1.
PDAMP5,5,2,1.
CDAMP5,30,5,1,2
$ drawn types in a form no block draws
CELAS2,31,10.,3,1
CELAS2,32,10.,3,1,101,0
CFAST,39,7,PROP,1,1
,0.5,0.,0.
PFAST,7,1.,,,1.,1.,1.
$ scalar points only
PELAS,3,100.
PDAMP,4,1.
PMASS,6,2.
CELAS3,33,3,101,102
CELAS4,34,5.,101
CDAMP3,35,4,101,102
CDAMP4,36,2.,101
CMASS3,37,6,101,102
CMASS4,38,3.,101
$ not drawn
CTRIAX6,40,1,1,2,3,8,13,7
CTRIAX6,41,1,3,4,5,10,15,9
PBUSH1D,8,100.
CBUSH1D,43,8,1,2
GENEL,44,,1,1,2,1
,UD,,3,1
,K,1.,2.,3.
PHBDY,9,1.
CHBDYP,45,9,POINT,,,1
DMI,WKK,0,2,1,0,,1,1
DMI,WKK,1,1,1.
SUPORT,3,3
SPCOFF,1,123
FORCE,9,3,0,1.,0.,0.,1.
SPC1,1,123,1
$ drawn since the pressure faces (Pressures/SID_9), so not in the report
PLOAD4,9,10,1.
PLOAD4,9,11,2.
$ not read: an unknown card, and CWELD (turned off: pyNastran 1.5 aborts on some forms)
FOOBAR,1,2
